        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43580235?u=cae42d5a371dd041072ce6d85a1808de05535be8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A few minor improvements to the <code class=\"notranslate\">webkitdirectory</code> page</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Checking for any additional improvements I can make while working on release docs for this.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Bugs</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzil.la/1973726\" rel=\"nofollow\">webkitRelativePath is always the empty string for webkitdirectory on Android</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Parent issue <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3256406047\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40511\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40511/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40511\">#40511</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Relnote <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3334360643\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40796\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40796/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40796\">#40796</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40797",
            "title": "chore(Fx142): tidy webkitdirectory page",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-19T14:35:23.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-19T13:48:40.000Z",
